# The full-scale dataset: its CSV files (all 34 tables) are committed, so reviewers can open the 30-entity / 150-account /
# 100,000-ledger-entry data directly. The JSON and SQL renderings of the same rows are not, because GitHub rejects files over
# 100 MB (seed.sql is 160 MB, forecast_position.json 110 MB). `cashpilot all --profile full` recreates them byte-identically;
# their checksums are in data/full/manifest.json.
data/full/json/
data/full/sql/

